    "I send Mom the required departure text, rinse the plate, and shoulder my bag."
    "It is heavier than yesterday."
    "Or I am more aware of what it contains."
    "{i}Six subjects, three days, and a Sunday pretending to be helpful.{/i}"
    "I lock the door behind me."
    $ hide_calendar()
    scene black with wipeleft_scene
    nier "The trip downtown is too ordinary to complain about."
    nier "The bus is half-empty. The morning streets are washed in clean light. A kid across the aisle kicks his shoes against the seat until his mother gives him one look and restores civic order."
