    "The public library sits above the sidewalk with the calm dignity of a building that has watched generations of students panic under better lighting."
    "Its glass doors reflect me back with a backpack, fixed hair, and the vague expression of someone trying to make panic look scheduled."
    "{i}Good morning, library.{/i}"
    "{i}Please be useful by noon.{/i}"
